          "content": "The synthesis requires two aldol condensations and two Cannizzaro\nreactions."
        },
        {
          "identifier": "C",
          "content": "The synthesis requires three aldol condensations and one Cannizzaro\nreaction."
        },
        {
          "identifier": "D",
          "content": "Alpha hydrogens of ethanol and methanol are involved in this\nreaction."
        }
      ],
      "correct_options": [
